   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Download (folders are inside your ComfyUI folder):\nQwen Image Edit 2509 (fits a 10 GB GPU):\n- models/unet/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Q3_K_S.gguf  (QuantStack/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-GGUF)\n- models/loras/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors  (lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning)\n- models/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors  (Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI)\n- models/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors  (Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI)\nNeeds the ComfyUI-GGUF pack (city96) for 'Unet Loader (GGUF)'.\nDetail fix:\n- models/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors  (SAM 3, loaded with Load Checkpoint; SAM3 Detect is a core node)\n- models/upscale_models/4x-UltraSharp.pth\n- input/novara_logo.png and input/novara_logo_white.png: your logo, dark and white versions\nNeeds the Detail Fixer pack (Detail Detect / Crop / Prepare Logo / Paste Back).\n- input/novara_logo_white_transparent.png: logo with transparency for the end card"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 0 · Models and references"
  },
