   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "The four keyframes saved by 02_novara_keyframes (output/NOVARA/keyframes_*.png). Pick your own stills here: one per shot, in shot order."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 1 · Keyframes"
  },
  {
   "id": 55,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    4300,
    70
   ],
   "size": [
    860,
    211
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 54,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Shot Critic sends every shot to a vision LLM (Gemini Flash Lite by default, 3 independent reviews, majority vote) with the shot list and your brand rules. Each shot gets a score and a route: pass, detail (local fix), consistency (edit against another shot) or reroll. The contact sheet shows the verdicts.\nAPI keys: set them as environment variables before starting ComfyUI, never in the workflow. GEMINI_API_KEY (or GOOGLE_API_KEY), ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_API_KEY.\nSlow or 503 errors: Gemini is busy; the critic falls back from Flash Lite to Flash by itself."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 2 · Shot Critic"
  },
  {
   "id": 56,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    30,
    2241
   ],
   "size": [
    900,
    154
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 55,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Shot Select picks only the shots the critic routed to 'detail' (a wrong logo, garbled text). SAM 3 finds the logo / text, Detail Fixer crops it, and Qwen Image Edit repaints it from your logo reference in 4 steps (Lightning LoRA). The crop is pasted back with a feathered mask, and Shot Reroll Merge (route = detail) puts the fixed shots in place.\nWhen no shot needs a detail fix, this whole group is skipped (lazy input): it costs nothing."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 3 · Detail fix on flagged shots"
  },
  {
   "id": 57,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    5860,
    2241
   ],
   "size": [
    900,
    97
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 56,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "A second Shot Critic reviews the fixed shots. Shot Keep Better keeps a fix only if it scores at least as well as the original (never make it worse), and saves the approved keyframes."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 4 · Review again, keep only improvements"
  },
  {
   "id": 58,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
    30,
    3535
   ],
   "size": [
    900,
    116
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 57,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Ad Timeline times the stills (durations in seconds per shot) with a gentle push-in and crossfades. Ad Supers draws the on-screen lines ('shot | text'). Ad End Card adds the logo, tagline and URL over the blurred last frame. Create Video + Save Video write the MP4. Add a voiceover and music with Ad Voiceover and Ad Audio Mix (see docs/NODES.md)."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 5 · Ad assembly (MP4)"
  }
